{"message":"The requested net change is the fiscal 2008 year-end unrecognized tax benefit balance minus the fiscal 2007 year-end balance. From the reconciliation table: December 27, 2008 ending balance = $214.4 million (source:t8c1n0); December 29, 2007 ending balance = $126.6 million (source:t8c2n0, also the beginning balance for fiscal 2008 in source:t1c1n0). Both are already in $ millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"214.4 - 126.6","variables":{"ending_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"USD_million"},"ending_2007":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t8c2n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"ending_2008":"source:t8c1n0","ending_2007":"source:t8c2n0"}}}